<title>USA: Ugly Duckling to finance First Merchants.</title>
<headline>Ugly Duckling to finance First Merchants.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ugly Duckling Corp said Friday it has entered an agreement to provide up to $10 million in debtor in possession financing to sub-prime automobile loan financer First Merchants Acceptance Corp.</p>
<p>First Merchants earlier Friday filed for Chapter 11 bankruptcy protection in U.S. Bankruptcy Court in Delaware.</p>
